SUMMARY:Keynote: MCP and the Era of Connectivity - David Soria Parra\, Co-creator of MCP\, Anthropic
DESCRIPTION:David will discuss the need for connectivity in an era of increasing AI capabilities. Open standards like MCP are at theheart of the AI revolution and the increased ability of models to reach out into the world. We discuss the last two years of MCP and look into the future of connectivity standards in the&nbsp\;industry.\n
CATEGORIES:KEYNOTE SESSIONS
LOCATION:Auditorium (Ground Floor)\, Amsterdam\, Netherlands
