SUMMARY:Prompt à la Carte - Table Topics
DESCRIPTION:Grab your lunch in the Sponsor Showcase\, then join us for impromptu topic discussions during lunch! These informal gatherings are open to anyone. Whether you are looking to share your insights\, hear diverse perspectives\, or network with fellow participants\, these discussions are a great way to connect and collaborate. Choose a table topic that interests you and dive into conversations.\n\nTopic 1: Human-Agent CollaborationTopic 2: Agentic EngineeringTopic 3: Security and GovernanceTopic 4: Agentic Memory\n
CATEGORIES:MEALS / BREAKS / SPECIAL EVENTS
LOCATION:Topaz Lounge (1st Floor)\, Amsterdam\, Netherlands
SEQUENCE:0
UID:adb64d2e9e7666de9fcedb3006994a7f
